{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20180","headline":"寻裴处士 · 孟郊","name":"寻裴处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涉水更登陆，所向皆清真。\n寒草不藏径，灵峰知有人。\n悠哉链金客，独与烟霞亲。\n曾是欲轻举，谁言空隐沦。\n远心寄白月，华发回青春。\n对此钦胜事，胡爲劳我身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}